sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App
    participant BLE as 蓝牙设备
    participant API as 后端
    opt 蓝牙接入
        App->>BLE: 连接 读取固件 IMEI 与 MAC
        BLE-->>App: 同一请求 SID 的身份回包
        App->>App: 校验完整 IMEI 与预期设备
    end
    App->>API: 读取对象详情 产品与既有绑定
    API-->>App: 当前目标及关联
    App->>App: 确认自有 ACTIVE 且未绑定其他对象
    App->>API: POST /app/device/bind
    Note right of App: bindType / bindToId / deviceId / productKey
    API-->>App: 业务响应
    App->>API: GET 对象 device-bindings
    API-->>App: 对象侧关联
    App->>API: GET /app/device/bindings<br/>条件：bindType、bindToId
    API-->>App: 通用关联视图
    App->>App: 比较记录 ID 目标 设备和产品
    Note over App: 两处一致才确认成功 否则先回查
    opt BLE 绑定确认后
        App->>App: 按账号与环境保存本地 BLE 关联
    end
